    path: "README.md",
    content:
      "# Interactive Circuit Maker Agent Kit\n\nThis private working folder is operating material for one browser-authorized\nsession. It is not a checkout of the editor and contains no Project data,\ncredential, or hidden tool.\n\nRead `AGENTS.md`, then `skills/icm-circuit-session/SKILL.md`, then\n`references/authoring-contract.md`. The checked-in\n`references/razavi-authoring-catalog.json` gives the reviewed built-in\nsymbols needed to author from an empty Document. Fetch the published OpenAPI\nbefore forming requests; it is the wire-contract authority.\n\n## Task reading map\n\nLoad only the relevant task documents. This map is generated from the distribution registry.\n\n| Task | Load | Document |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Simulation Spec rules and raw handoff | on-demand | [reference/simulation-specs](references/simulation-specs.md) |\n| Raw HTTP live-session workflow | required | [fallback/http-session-workflow](skills/icm-circuit-session/SKILL.md) |\n| Session contract | on-demand | [reference/session](references/session-contract.md) |\n| Built-in authoring contract | on-demand | [reference/authoring](references/authoring-contract.md) |\n| Schematic workflow | on-demand | [reference/workflow](references/workflow.md) |\n| Tool behavior | on-demand | [reference/tool-behavior](references/tool-behavior.md) |\n| Response semantics and recovery | on-demand | [reference/recovery](references/response-semantics.md) |\n| Route tree shapes | on-demand | [reference/routing](references/route-tree-shapes.md) |\n| Routing and diagnostics | on-demand | [reference/diagnostics](references/diagnostics.md) |\n| Circuit style knowledge | on-demand | [reference/razavi-style](references/circuit-style-knowledge.md) |\n| Advanced transaction contract | on-demand | [contract/advanced-edits](references/agent-circuit-request.schema.json) |\n| Bootstrap raw HTTP | entry | [http-kit/AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) |\n| Discover built-in symbols | on-demand | [catalog/builtins](references/razavi-authoring-catalog.json) |\n| Evidence-first circuit reading | on-demand | [reference/knowledge/circuit-reading](references/knowledge/circuit-reading.md) |\n| Hierarchy and large circuits | on-demand | [reference/knowledge/hierarchy-and-large-circuits](references/knowledge/hierarchy-and-large-circuits.md) |\n| PDK models and symbols | on-demand | [reference/knowledge/pdk-and-symbols](references/knowledge/pdk-and-symbols.md) |\n| Agent API Usage | on-demand | [reference/api-usage](references/api-usage.md) |\n| Reproducible Agent Workflows | on-demand | [reference/examples](references/examples.md) |\n| Agent simulation result handoff | on-demand | [reference/simulation-result-handoff](references/simulation-result-handoff.md) |\n| Shared simulation lifecycle | on-demand | [reference/simulation-workflow](references/simulation-workflow.md) |\n| Place recognizable circuit groups | on-demand | [reference/knowledge/patterns](references/knowledge/patterns.md) |\n",
